abstract: >-
  V2X-QA is a real-world multi-view visual question answering dataset and benchmark
  for autonomous driving across vehicle-side, infrastructure-side, and cooperative
  views, together with V2X-MoE, a Qwen3-VL-based viewpoint-specialized LoRA baseline.
keywords:
  - autonomous driving
  - multimodal large language models
  - visual question answering
  - V2X
  - cooperative reasoning
